(text "SPU and SPD high select full speed. PDEN is high at reset. VDD1 is the isolator internal LDO output: bypass only, no external loads." (at 25 230 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 03c4203b-3675-42bf-a931-d33c7c0e9b4e))
(text "PB5 asserts USB_CONNECT only after STM32 USB clocks and descriptors are ready; 100k holds the host pull-up disconnected at reset." (at 25 240 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 194b65ff-7f40-4a4b-a950-a04394514f06))
(text "STM32 still supplies the downstream USB D+ pull-up. Use the self-powered descriptor; USB absence is not sensed by a cross-barrier divider." (at 25 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid b65a78b5-0510-4d56-a56a-e2f888ef9911))
(text "Source: ADuM3160 Rev D, Table 9 and Figures 6/7. Isolated DC/DC startup, bus current and suspend remain a separate unimplemented decision." (at 25 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6a4656f3-83da-4dfc-abb2-c98d98c271f2))
(text "Isolated USB full-speed device interface" (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 15b296e5-be41-4d14-aa87-4c6504b1fd68))
(text "ADuM3160BRWZ, 12Mbit/s. Computer ground and board ground are separate. PD power is required; no isolated bus-power converter is selected." (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5f882b25-0c5a-4b0e-a7f3-62ac8b54968e)) (embedded_fonts no))